{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e7fc3379-f914-8e1a-8004-8815c84d0fe9",
  "created_at": "2026-03-12T12:35:32-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:31:12-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:31:15-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hi Greg. Yes, hello. Um, I'm calling about a fence. Or, well, I think it's a fence. Is it a fence if it's only this high? Sort of up to your knee, a little more?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:31:30-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, a low decorative fence is still a fence as far as we're concerned. What's the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:31:38-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 175 Kingston Avenue, up on the Hill. I manage it for the owner. Peter Chase, by the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:31:47-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Peter. And this is in the front yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:31:52-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Front yard, yes, along the walk, just to give it a little, you know, a border. Cedar. I want to do cedar. Whatever is allowed tall, I guess, though I don't want it tall, I want it short. [laughs] Sorry, that doesn't make sense, does it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:32:11-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It makes sense. You want it short, but you want to know the limit. Front yards usually have a lower height cap than backyards, so a short one is probably fine on that end. What are you actually planning, two feet, three?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:32:29-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably two and a half. Maybe three. Is there a height where it stops needing a permit? Like under three feet you're fine, over three feet you need one? Somebody told me that once, or I dreamed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:32:45-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wouldn't count on a magic number like that. In general a fence needs a permit, and since you're on the Hill, that's a historic district, so there may be an extra review for what faces the street. I'd plan on applying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:33:03-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Oh, so even the little one. Okay. So it's not that short ones are exempt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:33:10-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, I wouldn't assume they are. Best bet is to submit a simple application with a sketch showing where it goes, the height, and the material."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:33:21-04:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. I can do a sketch. I'm not an artist, but, um, a rectangle with a line. Is that okay? Wait, hold on, let me just, sorry, I have a casserole in the oven that needs ten more minutes, so I'm fine for now, but I'm watching the clock."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:33:42-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, then we'll keep it quick. A site plan with a line for the fence and measurements from the property lines works fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:33:52-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Measurements from the lines. Got it. And the fee? Is there a fee? I should ask what it costs, because the owner will ask me and I'll look silly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:34:04-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a fee, yes, but I don't have the number in front of me and it can depend on the project value. The permit office can give you the exact amount when you turn in the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:34:20-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it depends on how much the fence costs? Or how long it is? Sorry, which one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:34:28-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Typically it's tied to the value of the work, but confirm that with the office when you file. I don't want you writing down the wrong figure for your owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:34:41-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. So, to say it back. Yes, a permit, even for a short one. The Hill might mean extra review. Sketch with measurements. And ask about the fee when I file. Did I get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:34:56-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You can pick up the application here at City Hall or print it from the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:35:05-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Website, great. I'll find it. Although I may call back if I get lost on there, I get lost on everything. [laughs]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:35:15-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Just ask for zoning and inspections."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:35:19-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Greg. I'm going to go rescue the casserole in a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:35:26-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Enjoy it. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T12:35:29-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye now."
    }
  ],
